  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Compound flooding from tropical cyclone-induced sea surge and precipitation in Sri Lanka (C-FLOOD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research grant &#x2013; developing a new generation of compound flood hazard maps for Sri Lanka, based upon stateoftheart computer modelling that will consider all the storm surge components and the rainfall effect. Benefitting coastal communities in Sri Lanka through improved preparedness and improved evacuation strategies. SDGs: 13.</narrative>
  </description>
